{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_quicken","model_identifier":"spell_quicken","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_quicken\n\nSupport-mage quicken: four pale blue streaks circling a unit's legs (radius 10 u, 4-18 u high).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -11..11, y 4..20, z -11..11 units (0.61 x 0.45 x 0.61 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 16, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 12.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 22 x 16 x 22 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `loop` | 0.6 | loop | streaks whirl round the legs (one turn per 0.6 s) |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_streak0_0, glow_streak0_1, glow_streak0_2, glow_streak1_0, glow_streak1_1, glow_streak1_2, glow_streak2_0, glow_streak2_1, glow_streak2_2, glow_streak3_0, glow_streak3_1, glow_streak3_2\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":16},"elements":[{"name":"glow_streak0_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[9.5,4.0,-2.5],"to":[10.5,5.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[12.5,12.0,13.5,13.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4.5,8.0,9.5,9.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[12.5,12.0,13.5,13.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[4.5,8.0,9.5,9.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.5,0.5,1.5,5.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.5,0.5,1.5,5.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d9d3bfeb-0b24-5c72-ab30-c3ce4be69e7d"},{"name"